    "name": "Potion in Motion",
    "steam_appid": 3481340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/7fd5c67ce41e93aa5a8a3de6d67ba640.poster.avif?t=1750066421\" width=800 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/7fd5c67ce41e93aa5a8a3de6d67ba640.webm?t=1750066421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of potion-making, where every brew is a mix of magic, mystery, and just a little bit of chaos. Learn from your father\u2019s cryptic notes, experiment with mystical ingredients, and cast spells to refine your craft, all while keeping up with the endless demands of your quirky customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/df9d152c6b6db563ba8b27ed2ac96de0.poster.avif?t=1750066421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/df9d152c6b6db563ba8b27ed2ac96de0.webm?t=1750066421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/df9d152c6b6db563ba8b27ed2ac96de0.mp4?t=1750066421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/90fb70d9963af3635e418f7321de6438.poster.avif?t=1750066421\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/90fb70d9963af3635e418f7321de6438.apng?t=1750066421\" class=\"bb_img\" width=594 height=156 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Master the Unpredictable</strong>\u00a0- Every potion is a puzzle! Discover recipes, mix enchanted ingredients, and deal with unexpected reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Spellcasting &amp; Dual-Potion System</strong>\u00a0- Magic isn\u2019t just for show! Manipulate ingredients, combine effects, and experiment with alchemy like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>The Language of Magic</strong>\u00a0- Learn and translate <strong>Runetrian</strong>, an ancient magical script, to uncover powerful spells, understand ancient recipes, and refine your craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3c <strong>Your &quot;Helpful&quot; Feline Assistant</strong> - Astrid, the talking cat, will either guide you or roast your potion-making skills into hell and back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>A Race Against Time</strong>\u00a0- Customers won\u2019t wait forever! Balance speed and precision in Rue's Tale (Story Mode), or push your limits in Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Customers with Opinions</strong> - Some adore your work, others\u2026 not so much. Keep them happy, or prepare for some <i>dangerous\u00a0</i>consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc57\u00a0<strong>Sense of Style\u00a0</strong>- Decorate how you play the game with Outfits, and maybe even make it look <i>less</i> like a magical disaster zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Explore Gilderia\u00a0</strong>- As you delve into Rue's Tale, meet Gilderia's quirky citizens, and uncover secrets hidden in magic and history.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/7fd5c67ce41e93aa5a8a3de6d67ba640.poster.avif?t=1750066421\" width=800 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/7fd5c67ce41e93aa5a8a3de6d67ba640.webm?t=1750066421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of potion-making, where every brew is a mix of magic, mystery, and just a little bit of chaos. Learn from your father\u2019s cryptic notes, experiment with mystical ingredients, and cast spells to refine your craft, all while keeping up with the endless demands of your quirky customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/df9d152c6b6db563ba8b27ed2ac96de0.poster.avif?t=1750066421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/df9d152c6b6db563ba8b27ed2ac96de0.webm?t=1750066421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/df9d152c6b6db563ba8b27ed2ac96de0.mp4?t=1750066421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/90fb70d9963af3635e418f7321de6438.poster.avif?t=1750066421\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481340/extras/90fb70d9963af3635e418f7321de6438.apng?t=1750066421\" class=\"bb_img\" width=594 height=156 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Master the Unpredictable</strong>\u00a0- Every potion is a puzzle! Discover recipes, mix enchanted ingredients, and deal with unexpected reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Spellcasting &amp; Dual-Potion System</strong>\u00a0- Magic isn\u2019t just for show! Manipulate ingredients, combine effects, and experiment with alchemy like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>The Language of Magic</strong>\u00a0- Learn and translate <strong>Runetrian</strong>, an ancient magical script, to uncover powerful spells, understand ancient recipes, and refine your craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3c <strong>Your &quot;Helpful&quot; Feline Assistant</strong> - Astrid, the talking cat, will either guide you or roast your potion-making skills into hell and back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>A Race Against Time</strong>\u00a0- Customers won\u2019t wait forever! Balance speed and precision in Rue's Tale (Story Mode), or push your limits in Endless Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Customers with Opinions</strong> - Some adore your work, others\u2026 not so much. Keep them happy, or prepare for some <i>dangerous\u00a0</i>consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc57\u00a0<strong>Sense of Style\u00a0</strong>- Decorate how you play the game with Outfits, and maybe even make it look <i>less</i> like a magical disaster zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Explore Gilderia\u00a0</strong>- As you delve into Rue's Tale, meet Gilderia's quirky citizens, and uncover secrets hidden in magic and history.</p>",
    "short_description": "Brew potions, cast spells, and master alchemy in a fast-paced potion shop where magic and language intertwine. Experiment with weird ingredients, and manage quirky customers while avoiding failures! Every potion is a puzzle, but will you perfect your craft or turn your shop into a disaster zone?",
